  <RW_RingSizeTip>Tiles around the whole ring × tiles from one rim to the other. Hexes are vanilla-sized, so the ring's size sets how big it looks. Only the land coverage's share of it has tiles; that tile count is shown here, and more tiles are slower to generate and play.</RW_RingSizeTip>
